  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.261 Franklin Pierce Lake",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.261 Franklin Pierce Lake. The portion of Franklin Pierce Lake from 100 feet north of the northern lot line of property identified in the town of Antrim’s assessor’s map as parcel #206-027, into and including the entire area of Wheeler’s Cove, shall be a “no wake” area.\n\nSource. #12429, EXEMPT, eff 12-5-17",
